the supplied normalized target path to equal that destination within the fixture
book. For N5NN it is that source page's 05.NN.md. For N7NN it is that same source
page's 06.NN.review.md. Equal basename in a different page is not equal identity.
Refuse bad target/source/pass before support-record creation or any target write.
No newest-version guessing. Preserve exact bytes outside the declared section.

